Author: Yumi Yukimura <me.cafebabe@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Apr 28 15:58:05 2025 +0800

    LINEAGE: fs: Add fs that exposes Android boot image components as files
    
    Exposes the components of boot.img (header versions 0 to 4) and
    vendor_boot.img (versions 3 and 4) as files: kernel, ramdisk.img,
    second, recovery_dtbo, dtb, signature, vendor_ramdisk.img, the vendor
    ramdisk fragments, bootconfig.txt, a bootconfig.bin that is ready to be
    appended to a ramdisk, and *-info.cfg files that set variables with the
    names and command lines from the headers.
    
    The headers come from the disk, so treat them as untrusted: check the
    version and the page size, check the vendor ramdisk table against its
    limits, use 64-bit offsets, and quote the strings in the generated
    scripts.
    
    Assisted-by: LLM
    Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-sonnet-5-5
    
