    LINEAGE: command: Introduce loadstring command for loading partition data into variable (v2)
    
    Usage: loadstring DEVICE VARIABLE SIZE [OFFSET]
    
    Reads SIZE bytes at OFFSET from the disk or partition DEVICE and stores
    them as a string in VARIABLE. SIZE is limited to 64 KiB.
    
    Reject a wrong number of arguments and invalid numbers, and release the
    device and the buffer on all error paths.
    
