    LINEAGE: Add .clang-format
    
    Approximate the GNU coding style that the GRUB source code uses: tabs
    for 8 column indentation, 2 spaces per level, GNU braces, a space before
    every opening parenthesis and return types on their own line.
    
    The upstream code is not entirely consistent, so this is meant for new
    files and changed lines (git clang-format), not for reformatting
    upstream files.
    
